5. EXPERIMENTAL VALIDATION
5.1 Validation Protocol
Each run followed a standardized protocol:

python
def validate(horizon, n_seeds=2):
    results = []
    for seed in range(n_seeds):
        system = Phase11System(config, seed)
        system.run(steps=horizon)
        results.append(extract_metrics(system))
    return aggregate(results)
Validation Horizons: [5000, 10000, 25000, 50000] steps

Metrics Measured: Divergence, Novelty, Utility, Entropy, Stability

Statistical Treatment: Mean across seeds, window averaging over last 10% of steps

