6.2 Ablation Studies
6.2.1 Component Ablation
Component Removed	Novelty	Utility	Verdict
None (Full)	0.151	0.54	Baseline
ES Updates	0.023	0.31	Essential
Behavioral Archive	0.067	0.52	Important
Task Switching	0.089	0.44	Necessary
Environmental Drift	0.112	0.48	Helpful
Entropy Regularization	0.034	0.39	Critical
Key Finding: Entropy regularization prevents degenerate constant-output solutions.

6.2.2 Fitness Weight Ablation
Configuration	Div Weight	Util Weight	Result
Original	0.25	0.20	D=0.33, U=0.54
High Divergence	0.40	0.10	D=0.51, U=0.28 (incoherent)
High Utility	0.10	0.40	D=0.21, U=0.61 (low diversity)
Balanced	0.25	0.20	D=0.33, U=0.54
Optimal weights: The validated configuration balances divergence pressure with functional utility.

