10.2 Theoretical Justification
The Representational Novelty Ceiling Theorem proves that no amount of law evolution within fixed 
d
d can achieve open-ended novelty.

10.3 Phase 12 Design Principles
To break the ceiling, Phase 12 introduces:

Layer 1: Raw Signal Buffer

Pre-symbolic signal accumulation before labeling

Familiarity detection without recognition

